<?php /** @var \Sysfera\Plugin $sf @var array $mine @var array $queue @var array $cal @var string $month @var string $team @var array $teams @var array $schedules @var ?array $balance @var string $meUuid @var bool $canHr @var bool $canEdit @var ?int $myId */
include __DIR__ . '/_nav.php';
$first = strtotime($month . '-01 12:00:00'); $days = (int)date('t', $first); $lead = (int)date('N', $first) - 1;
$prev = date('Y-m', strtotime('-1 month', $first)); $next = date('Y-m', strtotime('+1 month', $first)); $q = fn(string $m) => $sf->url('/leave?month=' . $m . ($team !== '' ? '&team=' . $team : '')); ?>
<div class="page-h"><h1><?= e($sf->t('nav_leave')) ?></h1></div>
<?php if ($balance): ?><div class="hint"><?= e($sf->t('bal_accrued')) ?>: <b><?= e((string)$balance['accrued']) ?></b> · <?= e($sf->t('bal_used')) ?>: <b><?= e((string)$balance['used']) ?></b> · <?= e($sf->t('bal_available')) ?>: <b><?= e((string)$balance['available']) ?></b></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($meUuid !== ''): ?><div class="card"><h3><?= e($sf->t('leave_new')) ?></h3>
  <form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/do/leave.request')) ?>" class="row"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="return" value="/leave"><input type="hidden" name="employee_uuid" value="<?= e($meUuid) ?>">
    <select name="kind"><?php foreach (\SysferaHr\TimeOff::KINDS as $k): ?><option value="<?= e($k) ?>"><?= e($sf->t('lk_' . $k)) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><input type="date" name="starts_on" required><input type="date" name="ends_on" required><input name="note" placeholder="<?= e($sf->t('f_note')) ?>" maxlength="300"><button class="btn primary"><?= e($sf->t('request')) ?></button></form></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($mine): ?><div class="card flush"><h3 style="padding:12px 12px 0"><?= e($sf->t('my_leave')) ?></h3><table class="tbl"><?php foreach ($mine as $l): ?><tr><td><?= e($sf->t('lk_' . $l['kind'])) ?></td><td><?= e($l['starts_on']) ?> – <?= e($l['ends_on']) ?> (<?= e((string)$l['days']) ?>)</td><td><span class="hr-st <?= $hrst($l['status']) ?>"><?= e($sf->t('ls_' . $l['status'])) ?></span></td>
  <td><?php if (in_array($l['status'], ['pending_manager', 'pending_hr', 'approved'], true)): ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/do/leave.cancel')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="return" value="/leave"><input type="hidden" name="uuid" value="<?= e($l['uuid']) ?>"><button class="btn sm"><?= e($sf->t('cancel')) ?></button></form><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php $todo = array_values(array_filter($queue, fn($l) => (int)$l['employee_id'] !== (int)$myId)); if ($todo): ?><div class="card flush"><h3 style="padding:12px 12px 0"><?= e($sf->t('leave_queue')) ?></h3><table class="tbl"><?php foreach ($todo as $l): ?><tr><td><a href="<?= e($sf->url('/employees/' . $l['employee_uuid'])) ?>"><?= e($sf->t('lk_' . $l['kind'])) ?></a></td><td><?= e($l['starts_on']) ?> – <?= e($l['ends_on']) ?> (<?= e((string)$l['days']) ?>)</td><td><span class="hr-st <?= $hrst($l['status']) ?>"><?= e($sf->t('ls_' . $l['status'])) ?></span></td>
  <td><?php foreach (['approve' => 'btn sm primary', 'reject' => 'btn sm'] as $d => $cls): ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/do/leave.decide')) ?>" style="display:inline"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="return" value="/leave"><input type="hidden" name="uuid" value="<?= e($l['uuid']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="decision" value="<?= e($d) ?>"><button class="<?= e($cls) ?>"><?= e($sf->t('act_' . $d)) ?></button></form><?php endforeach; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table></div><?php endif; ?>

<div class="card"><h3><?= e($sf->t('team_calendar')) ?> · <?= e($month) ?></h3>
  <div class="row hr-noprint"><a class="btn sm" href="<?= e($q($prev)) ?>">←</a><a class="btn sm" href="<?= e($q($next)) ?>">→</a>
    <form method="get" class="row"><input type="hidden" name="month" value="<?= e($month) ?>"><select name="team" onchange="this.form.submit()"><option value=""><?= e($sf->t('all_teams')) ?></option><?php foreach ($teams as $t): ?><option value="<?= e($t['uuid']) ?>" <?= $team === $t['uuid'] ? 'selected' : '' ?>><?= e($t['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></form></div>
  <div class="hr-cal"><?php for ($i = 0; $i < $lead; $i++): ?><div></div><?php endfor; ?>
    <?php for ($d = 1; $d <= $days; $d++): $date = sprintf('%s-%02d', $month, $d); ?><div><b><?= $d ?></b><?php foreach ($cal['entries'] as $en): if ($en['starts_on'] <= $date && $en['ends_on'] >= $date): ?><span class="away" title="<?= e($en['full_name']) ?>"><?= e($en['full_name']) ?> · <?= e($sf->t('lk_' . $en['kind'])) ?></span><?php endif; endforeach; ?></div><?php endfor; ?></div></div>

<?php if ($schedules || $canEdit): ?><div class="card"><h3><?= e($sf->t('schedules')) ?></h3><p class="muted"><?= e($sf->t('schedules_hint')) ?></p>
  <?php foreach ($schedules as $s): ?><p><b><?= e($s['name']) ?></b> <?php foreach ($s['week_hours'] as $dn => $h): ?><span class="hr-st"><?= e($sf->t('wd_' . $dn)) ?> <?= e((string)$h) ?></span> <?php endforeach; ?></p><?php endforeach; ?>
  <?php if ($canEdit): ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/do/schedules.save')) ?>" class="row"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="return" value="/leave"><input name="name" required placeholder="<?= e($sf->t('f_name')) ?>">
    <?php for ($dn = 1; $dn <= 7; $dn++): ?><label><?= e($sf->t('wd_' . $dn)) ?> <input name="week[<?= $dn ?>]" value="<?= $dn <= 5 ? '8' : '0' ?>" size="3" inputmode="decimal"></label><?php endfor; ?><button class="btn primary"><?= e($sf->t('add')) ?></button></form><?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
